<section class="pagehead"><div class="wrap narrow"><h1>Privacy & terms</h1><p class="muted small">Draft for the prototype. Have it checked before launch.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap narrow prose section">
  <h2>What we are</h2>
  <p>Where To Spot Dive is an independent directory of freediving and diving providers in Dahab, Egypt. We do not run courses, dives or trips, and we are not responsible for the services providers offer. Always check your instructor's qualifications, never dive alone, and stay within your training.</p>
  <h2>Listings</h2>
  <p>Providers send us their own details. A "Verified" badge means we checked the instructor's certificate on the agency's public records on the date shown; it is not a guarantee of safety or quality. Prices are what providers told us and can change.</p>
  <h2>Your data</h2>
  <p>When you send an inquiry, we store your name, contact details and message, and share them only with the provider you contacted so they can reply. We count clicks on contact links (without storing who you are) to show providers how many people we send them. We don't sell data. To have your data deleted, contact us.</p>
  <h2>Conditions</h2>
  <p>Weather and sea data come from Open-Meteo. Our "calm / chop / rough" labels are estimates, not safety advice. Your instructor decides on the day.</p>
</div>
